analysis. One has been false memories and the third has been belief in conspiracies. And there's a kind of, you know, they all kind of are linked to each other quite strongly. It's really, I mean, I'm fascinated by the whole topic of weird beliefs and where do they come from. There are many conspiracy theories that do have an explicitly paranormal angle to them. Obviously, they don't all have. But so many kind of links. between the kind of factors which influence whether or not people believe in conspiracies, whether or not people believe in the paranormal, the supernatural, alternative medicine. The list goes on.
分析。一个是错误记忆，第三个是对阴谋论的信仰。它们彼此之间有着非常强烈的某种联系。说实话，我对关于奇异信念的整个话题以及它们从何而来非常着迷。有许多阴谋论确实包含明确的超自然角度。显然，并不是所有阴谋论都这样。但是有那么多因素相互关联，这些因素影响着人们是否相信阴谋论、是否相信超自然现象、超自然能力或替代医学。这样的例子不胜枚举。

